{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"4328","title":"Xiaomi SU7 Ultra Officially Opens Sale with a Starting Price of RMB 529,900","desc":"As the flagship model of Xiaomi SU7 Series, Xiaomi SU7 Ultra was developed with the goal of redefining standards for high-performance luxury vehicles.","view_cnt":"283470","like_cnt":"10","add_time":"1740659180","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/438_operatorx_operatorx_opx/27/02/2025/9bc13c645f0b719f01c283be9ee6ba32.png"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeijing, February 27, 2025\u003c/strong\u003e — Xiaomi today announced the start of official sales of Xiaomi SU7 Ultra, with a starting price of RMB \u003cspan\u003e529,900\u003c/span\u003e. As the flagship model of Xiaomi SU7 Series, Xiaomi SU7 Ultra was developed with the goal of redefining standards for high-performance luxury vehicles.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn addition to the standard version of Xiaomi SU7 Ultra priced at RMB \u003cspan\u003e529,900\u003c/span\u003e, Xiaomi also announced a range of optional configurations available, including the \"Racing Package\" and the \"Nürburgring Nordschleife Limited Edition\". Both will be officially available when the production unit of Xiaomi SU7 Ultra has completed its Nürburgring Nordschleife lap challenge.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SU7 Ultra features the same tri-motor configuration as well as track-optimized, high-power battery pack as Xiaomi SU7 Ultra Prototype, generating a maximum horsepower of 1548PS and a maximum acceleration from 0 to 100km/h in just 1.98s (without one foot rollout). It sets new benchmark as the world's fastest mass-produced four-door sedan at present to reach a maximum speed of 350km/h. Xiaomi SU7 Ultra comes with a track-optimized cooling system, ensuring the completion of two consecutive laps on the Nürburgring Nordschleife without overheating. It is equipped with a top-level braking system, achieving a braking distance from 100km/h to 0 in only 30.8m. Xiaomi SU7 Ultra features a peak chassis system tuned at the Nürburgring Nordschleife, delivering better chassis control and a higher control ceiling. It comes track-ready straight from the factory. \u003cstrong\u003eIn addition, Xiaomi SU7 Ultra offers upgrades in terms of luxury design, premium experience, peak performance, advanced technology, and safety assurance.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/797_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/02/2025/479c8770d6618f022305fb1bb08befb5.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SU7 Ultra will continue to challenge professional racetracks across Mainland China. It has previously completed lap times at four major domestic racetracks:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe fastest production car at Shanghai International Circuit (SIC): \u003cspan\u003e2'09\"944\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe fastest four-door, mass-produced car at Chengdu Tianfu International Circuit: \u003cspan\u003e1’26\"741\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe fastest four-door, mass-produced car at Zhuzhou International Circuit: \u003cspan\u003e1'41\"806\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe fastest four-door, mass-produced car at Zhuhai International Circuit: \u003cspan\u003e1'37\"758\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Auto will continue to explore technological innovations in electric vehicles and conduct verification and optimization on the Nürburgring Nordschleife. The mass-produced version of Xiaomi SU7 Ultra will officially challenge the Nürburgring Nordschleife this year.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLuxury design: Sporty yet elegant, a design that leads the times\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAs a \"New Luxury Vehicle\", Xiaomi SU7 Ultra combines powerful performance with elegant aesthetics. To this end, Xiaomi SU7 Ultra comes in five exterior colors: Lightning Yellow, Space Silver, Verdant Green, Pearl White, and Obsidian Black.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/711_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/02/2025/8e0935808bd48f4955913bf17ea9789a.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe design of Xiaomi SU7 Ultra prioritizes peak performance, with each new design element serving functional purposes, free from unnecessary decoration. For exterior design, Xiaomi SU7 Ultra builds on Xiaomi SU7 Max with an added aerodynamic kit and larger body dimensions. At 5115mm length, 1970mm width, 1465mm height, and 3000mm wheelbase, the body is longer, lower, and presents a more aggressive, battle-ready stance. The front of Xiaomi SU7 Ultra features an oversized front splitter and air dam, along with \"U-shaped\" air curtains to effectively increase the downforce of the front of the car. The enlarged air intake grille allows the cooling area to be increased by 10%. An active rear diffuser has been added, with two-level adaptive adjustment, balancing wind resistance and downforce, and energy efficiency for daily driving. Additionally, a new carbon fiber fixed rear spoiler (1560mm wingspan, 240mm chord length) delivers considerable downforce at high speeds. Thanks to the new aerodynamic design, Xiaomi SU7 Ultra achieves a maximum downforce of 285kg, comparable to that of a supercar.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/89_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/02/2025/2bdc0932ae9ad9ed5da29148b6d2c69f.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SU7 Ultra extensively uses carbon fiber materials, enhancing sportiness and reducing weight. Interior carbon fiber elements include the front-seat back panels, center console panel, and door sill plates, reinforcing the athletic aesthetic. For exterior design, Xiaomi SU7 Ultra features a 1.7m² large carbon fiber roof*, reducing weight by 11kg. Carbon fiber appears in 21 locations, totaling 5.5m². 90% of these components are manufactured using premium hot press process, ensuring superior texture and quality.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, Xiaomi SU7 Ultra Series comes standard with a 24K gold carbon fiber emblem, combining black and gold for a unique and modest yet luxurious touch that subtly conveys power.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/264_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/02/2025/574c5e44dfff5f6b14c0cafbf49f7734.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExperiencing luxury: High-performance and luxurious car under one million RMB\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe interior of Xiaomi SU7 Ultra emphasizes sportiness through upgraded seats and steering wheel design. The new sports seats feature enhances active side support with faster response speed and larger support area, providing better body control during intense driving. The seats showcase exclusive track embroidery stripes and Ultra embroidered logo, adding to the sporty aesthetic. The steering wheel of Xiaomi SU7 features a completely new design, adopting a race-designed flat top and bottom. The material has been upgraded to carbon fiber. The grip area of the steering wheel is covered with Alcantara® microfiber fabric, which is not easy to slip. A yellow centering marker at the 12 o'clock point aids steering during intense handling. The new design, coupled with the yellow seat belts and the red Boost button on the steering wheel, creating a race-ready cockpit atmosphere at the interior of Xiaomi SU7 Ultra.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/993_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/02/2025/5ddc5679a0c71b3e4cef00a92178d6e4.png\"\u003eThe interior materials of Xiaomi SU7 Ultra are also further enhanced, with Italian Alcantara® microfiber fabric extensively used throughout the car, covering over 5m². The material wraps the full seat contact surfaces, steering wheel grip areas, dashboard stitching, and the interior door panels, delivering a premium feel and a more immersive driving environment.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/164_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/02/2025/43023c5c579f3c90005b486b23351c1d.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe interior of the Xiaomi SU7 Ultra has been significantly upgraded, featuring premium materials and a range of striking new color options. Drivers can choose from \u003cstrong\u003ebold and vibrant Bright Yellow (Yellow/Black), sleek Black/Yellow, or subtle yet sophisticated Black/Red interiors\u003c/strong\u003e. For enhanced comfort, Xiaomi SU7 Ultra's front seats are equipped with ventilation, massage functionality, and graphene heating for both rows. The seats have also been redesigned with improved contours, upgraded padding, and higher side bolsters, delivering superior support and an elevated level of comfort for every journey.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/26_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/02/2025/a2204e41055964da73dba03c5a4c591b.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SU7 Ultra introduces a newly upgraded electric hood, operable via smartphone, XiaoAi AI voice commands, and newly added physical buttons for added convenience. In addition, the vehicle now features dual 50W wireless phone charging, auto-dimming rearview mirrors, BSD (blind-spot detection) lights, and three-level adjustable color temperature and brightness for the front vanity mirrors. These enhancements deliver a more refined and luxurious driving experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePeak performance: The world's fastest mass-produced four-door sedan at present with 1548PS, 0-100km/h sprint in 1.98 seconds, designed top speed of 350km/h\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAs Xiaomi's high-performance EV flagship, Xiaomi SU7 Ultra shares the same power system with the prototype car, delivering peak performance.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SU7 Ultra generates a maximum horsepower of 1548PS and a maximum acceleration from 0 to 100km/h in just 1.98s (without one foot rollout). It sets new benchmark as the world's first mass-produced four-door sedan to achieve a maximum acceleration from 0 to 200km/h in just 5.86s and to reach a designed maximum speed of 350km/h.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Xiaomi SU7 Ultra's peak performance is backed by advanced technology. It shares the prototype's tri-motor configuration - two V8s e-motors and one V6s e-motor, marking the first mass production of Xiaomi's self-developed HyperEngine V8s. The HyperEngine V8s achieves a maximum revolution of 27,200rpm, making it one of the highest-revolution and most powerful mass-produced main drive e-motors available.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/322_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/02/2025/d0e8c58a2cd1cbc672783cc584a35a48.png\"\u003eIn terms of battery, Xiaomi SU7 Ultra features the same track-optimized, high-power battery pack as the prototype car, debuting CATL Qilin 2.0 battery. As one of the most powerful mass-produced battery packs available, it delivers a maximum discharge rate of 16C and a maximum discharge power of 1330kW. When the power is only 20% left, the discharge power can still reach 800kW. The highest charging rate is 5.2C, enabling 10% to 80% charging in just 11 minutes. The CLTC range reaches 630km, combing high performance and long range. Integrating Xiaomi’s CTB battery technology for higher volume efficiency, the battery pack features dual large-surface active cooling to ensure stronger battery heat dissipation capabilities and safety guarantees.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/649_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/02/2025/d9606027a22748511840ee0d31079e95.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor electric vehicles to achieve long-lasting and stable high performance, they require exceptional systematic cooling capabilities. Xiaomi SU7 Ultra has upgraded its cooling system in all aspects. The performance of the compressor, water pump, cooling fan and radiator have all been greatly enhanced. The maximum heat dissipation per minute reaches 2.7*10^6J, triple the heat dissipation capacity of an ordinary EV, effectively ensuring that it will not overheat during two consecutive hot laps on the Nürburgring Nordschleife.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Xiaomi SU7 Ultra is equipped with a top-level braking system, including carbon ceramic brake discs, high-performance fixed calipers, and high-performance brake pads. It achieves a braking distance from 100km/h to 0 in only 30.8m, and completes 10 consecutive 180km/h-0 braking tests without fading. The diameter of the front brake disc reaches 430mm, which is one of the largest carbon ceramic discs currently equipped on a sedan. The Xiaomi SU7 Ultra is also equipped with Akebono® high-performance brake calipers. The working areas of the fixed calipers with six pistons at front and four pistons at rear reach 148cm² and 93cm² respectively, delivering exceptional strong braking performance.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SU7 Ultra features a peak chassis system tuned at the Nürburgring Nordschleife, delivering better chassis control and a higher control ceiling. As a four-door \"race car\", it comes track-ready straight from the factory. In terms of suspension, Xiaomi SU7 Ultra features dual-chamber air springs paired with high-performance adaptive dampers, offering a wider range of spring stiffness and damping adjustment. This ensures a more comfortable ride in standard mode and a more dynamic experience in sports mode. When it comes to chassis control, the Xiaomi SU7 Ultra tri-motor configuration achieves torque-vectoring control. The torque of the three e-motors is independently and dynamically distributed, and the e-motor torque is adjusted at a frequency of 500 times per second, which greatly enhances the vehicle's handling and stability. This torque-vectoring control system is designed in accordance with the industry's highest ASIL-D functional safety standard, and the fastest fault coordinated shutdown time is only 14ms, effectively ensuring the safety of the vehicle.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/129_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/02/2025/f16003bb3a6b66fcbaef9103d3f07396.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SU7 Ultra comes with Xiaomi tri-motor configuration, a track optimized high-power battery pack, a track optimized cooling system, a track optimized brake system, dual-chamber air springs, and high-performance continuous damping control, so you can enjoy the fun of extreme speed on the track.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor enthusiasts who crave ultimate performance, Xiaomi SU7 Ultra offers \"Racing Package\" to choose from. It includes \u003cstrong\u003eBilstein® EVO R for Ultra coilover shock absorbers, ENDLESS® high-performance brake pads, Pirelli® P ZERO™️ fifth-generation high-performance tires, an additional set of Pirelli® P ZERO™️ TROFEO RS semi-slick tires, 21-inch U-shaped forged wheel hubs, carbon fiber rear wheel arches, a 1.7㎡ carbon fiber roof, and more.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/466_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/02/2025/552d90edeb533a1902b1674b25f3b9ed.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLuxurious tech for an unparalleled immersive experience: Xiaomi HyperOS Smart Cabin and Racetrack Master app\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SU7 Ultra adopts advanced software features to ensure an unparalleled immersive driving experience. \u003cstrong\u003eBy seamlessly integrating a \"Human x Car x Home\" smart ecosystem through XiaoAi AI voice assistant, users can enjoy a fully connected and immersive cabin experience. \u003c/strong\u003eTo support these software features, Xiaomi SU7 Ultra is equipped with the flagship Snapdragon® 8295 chip platform across all variants. Combined with the powerful compatibility of Xiaomi HyperOS, it enables precise allocation of hardware resources, ensuring a responsive, smooth, and seamless infotainment system.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/206_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/02/2025/c3874b6fbbf8919a4f5345e3854b6d0d.jpg\"\u003eXiaomi SU7 Ultra introduces a new visual and auditory experience, along with an exclusive Racetrack Master app, offering users a peak sensory experience. Some UI interfaces of the central control screen, instrument panel, and HUD have been upgraded for a more stylish and sporty cabin. Driving sound enhancement system offers three new types of sound: super power, super sound, and super pulse, and adds a 40W external speaker to support sound waves for external playback.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SU7 Ultra has developed a powerful exclusive Racetrack Master app for track users. The Racetrack Master app can display full vehicle information, including real-time lap results, vehicle status, driving mode adjustment, etc. When drivers start racing, they can set a benchmarking lap time to display the difference between the current lap time and the benchmarking lap time in real time, maximizing competitive engagement. After the race, it supports historical lap statistics and visual analysis of results, and key parameters such as maximum speed, maximum G force, steering wheel angle, and braking force. Drivers are able to export and share their race videos with just one click.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SU7 Ultra offers comprehensive driving modes for both track safety and daily driving use. For track performance, there are endurance mode, qualifying mode and drift mode to choose from, bringing endless driving fun. For daily driving, options include beginner mode, economy mode, wet mode, sport mode, and custom mode, among others. In order to ensure safe driving, to activate track mode for the first time in the Xiaomi SU7 Ultra, drivers must obtain driving skills or qualification certifications. The daily driving mode includes power and speed limitations.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEnhanced safety, comprehensive protection\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSafety is paramount for Xiaomi Auto. Xiaomi SU7 Ultra's active safety features have been further upgraded, aiming at offering the strongest safety experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SU7 Ultra introduces new features such as MAI (Mis-Acceleration Inhibition) and LAEB (Low Speed Autonomous Emergency Braking). In situations with a collision risk in which the accelerator pedal will not respond, the system will automatically suppress vehicle acceleration. Additionally, when a collision with an obstacle is detected, the system will activate the Autonomous Emergency Braking (AEB) system to complete braking, further avoiding or mitigating collision risks.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFurthermore, in terms of battery safety, the battery pack now features a bulletproof coating on the bottom, offering tear, scratch, and puncture resistance more than 10 times higher than traditional PVC coatings. This provides enhanced protection for the battery cells in incidents such as underbody scrapes, ensuring vehicle safety.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/429_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/02/2025/a7a50e82449e7abb29d7cc4358ad2689.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi SU7 Ultra - available today\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SU7 Ultra is the ultimate dream car crafted for those who pursue peak performance, embrace a life of exhilaration, and strive to transcend the ordinary. Seamlessly blending power and elegance, it is equally at home on the streets and the track. As a symbol of the new era, Xiaomi SU7 Ultra redefines luxury and performance, earning its place as the \"New Luxury Vehicle\" of our time.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SU7 Ultra is available today through Xiaomi Auto App or Xiaomi Auto WeChat Mini Program.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e*Some configurations are optional and are subject to delivery.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eData in this press release retrieved from Xiaomi Auto Lab and/or partners, and may vary depending on models/configurations.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eENDS\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (1810.HK). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmbracing our vision of “Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users’ hearts”, Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is one of the world’s leading smartphone companies. In September 2024, the MAU reached approximately 685.8 million globally. The company has also established the world’s leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform, reached approximately 861.4 million smart devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops and tablets) as of September 30, 2024. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to “Human × Car × Home” smart ecosystem, seamlessly merges personal devices, smart home products, and cars. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In August 2024, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the sixth year in a row.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"833","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1740662490"},"common":null}